# Omarchy core package list for Apple Silicon systems running Fedora Asahi Remix.
# Derived from install/omarchy-base-asahi.packages with Fedora RPM equivalents.
#
# Conversion sources:
#   - Confirmed equivalences: diff malik-na/omarchy-mac -> malik-na/omarchy-mac-fedora
#     and Research.md from that repo.
#   - COPR Hyprland: lionheartp/Hyprland (confirmed by user, replaces deprecated technochip/Hyprland-aarch64)
#   - Fedora Asahi platform packages: provided by Fedora Asahi Remix -- DO NOT reinstall.
#
# Packages marked "# TODO: confirm" have no verified RPM equivalent yet.
# Do not install them without checking on a real Fedora Asahi chroot first.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Fedora Asahi platform -- provided by the Fedora Asahi Remix base install.
# These are NOT in the package list; they must NOT be overridden or reinstalled.
# (was: asahi-desktop-meta, asahi-fwextract, linux-asahi, linux-asahi-headers,
#  mesa, mesa-demos, mesa-utils, fwupd, widevine)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

